  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mi>x</mi></mfrac></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mn>9</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mn>7</mn></math>. If&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mfenced><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>4</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to _____.</p>",
    "image": null
